<title>USA: Accent Color sees losses through Q4.</title>
<headline>Accent Color sees losses through Q4.</headline>
<dateline>EAST HARTFORD, Conn. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accent Color Sciences Inc said Friday it expects to post quarterly net losses through at least the fourth quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>For the first quarter ended March 31, Accent posted a net loss of $0.40 a share, compared to a proforma net loss of $0.30 a share.</p>
<p>Accent Color makes high-speed, spot color printing systems for integration with digital, high speed, black-on-white printers. The company launched its initial public offering in December.</p>
</text>
